@if(!$enabled)<section class="panel" style="display:block"><div class="disabled"><strong>Belum ada antrean online aktif.</strong><p>QR check-in tidak ditampilkan.</p></div></section>
@else<section class="panel"><div class="copy"><div id="waiting"><h1>Pindai untuk check-in</h1><p>Gunakan kamera HP atau Google Lens. Siapkan kode booking dan 4 digit terakhir NIK.</p><div class="steps"><div class="step"><b>1</b><span>Pindai QR pada layar ini.</span></div><div class="step"><b>2</b><span>Konfirmasi data reservasi melalui HP.</span></div><div class="step"><b>3</b><span>Ambil tiket yang dicetak mesin.</span></div></div><div class="note">QR berlaku singkat dan hanya menerima satu check-in.</div></div><div class="result" id="result"><strong>Check-in berhasil</strong><div class="number" id="number"></div><p>Mohon tunggu sebentar, tiket sedang dicetak.</p></div></div><div class="qrside"><div><div class="qr">{!! \SimpleSoftwareIO\QrCode\Facades\QrCode::size(245)->margin(1)->generate(route('online-queue.checkin.phone',$token)) !!}</div><div class="timer" id="timer">Berlaku 01:30</div><p>Halaman akan membuat QR baru otomatis jika waktu habis.</p></div></div></section>
<script>
(()=>{let left=90,done=false;const timer=document.getElementById('timer');const pollUrl=@json(route('online-queue.checkin.status',$token));const post=async(url)=>{const r=await fetch(url,{method:'POST',credentials:'same-origin',headers:{Accept:'application/json','X-Requested-With':'XMLHttpRequest','X-CSRF-TOKEN':document.querySelector('meta[name=csrf-token]').content}});if(!r.ok)throw new Error('Konfirmasi cetak gagal');return r.json()};const print=async(t)=>{done=true;document.getElementById('waiting').style.display='none';document.getElementById('result').style.display='block';document.getElementById('number').textContent=t.number;const f=document.createElement('iframe');f.className='print-frame';document.body.appendChild(f);try{await new Promise((ok,no)=>{const x=setTimeout(()=>no(new Error('Tiket tidak termuat')),12000);f.onload=()=>{clearTimeout(x);ok()};f.src=t.print_url});f.contentWindow.focus();f.contentWindow.print();setTimeout(()=>post(t.confirm_url).catch(()=>{}),1200)}finally{setTimeout(()=>location.reload(),7000)}};const poll=async()=>{if(done)return;try{const r=await fetch(pollUrl,{headers:{Accept:'application/json'},credentials:'same-origin'});if(r.status===410){location.reload();return}if(r.ok){const t=await r.json();if(t.status==='completed')await print(t)}}catch(e){}};setInterval(poll,1800);setInterval(()=>{if(done)return;left--;timer.textContent=`Berlaku ${String(Math.floor(left/60)).padStart(2,'0')}:${String(left%60).padStart(2,'0')}`;if(left<=0)location.reload()},1000)})()
</script>@endif</main></body></html>
